# Finder sidebar Favorites, top to bottom.
# macos.sh rebuilds them with mysides when this list and `mysides list` differ,
# then restarts Finder. A matching list is left alone.
# Format: name | path
#   path is absolute, or starts with @HOME@ (that becomes $HOME).
#   mysides stores a file:// address. A trailing slash is not a difference.
# Blank lines and lines beginning with # are ignored.
Applications|/Applications
Desktop|@HOME@/Desktop
Developer|@HOME@/Developer
Documents|@HOME@/Documents
Downloads|@HOME@/Downloads
Movies|@HOME@/Movies
Music|@HOME@/Music
Pictures|@HOME@/Pictures
